<catalogue name="Imperium - Adeptus Mechanicum" id="b93f-e4d3-1883-c498" authorContact="Centuria Astartes Discord, ask for AHeras." authorName="A. Heras" authorUrl="Centuria Astartes Discord" battleScribeVersion="2.03" gameSystemId="5b78-3a13-0882-b019" gameSystemRevision="4" library="false" revision="3" type="catalogue" xmlns="http://www.battlescribe.net/schema/catalogueSchema">
  <readme>Inspired from the original Warhammer 40,000 9th Edition database, created by BSData Developers, @WH40k Data Dev, from https://www.bsdata.net/contact.

Additional reference data obtained from Wahapedia, https://wahapedia.ru/</readme>
  <categoryEntries>
    <categoryEntry name="Canticles of the Omnissiah" id="2f88-4d5f-a2bc-cea1" hidden="false">
      <profiles>
        <profile name="Machine&apos;s Choir" id="d9f5-57fd-0720-9a14" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Models in this unit are affected by the current Canticle of the Omnissiah</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
    </categoryEntry>
    <categoryEntry name="Forgeworld: Agripinaa" id="b915-ab89-040f-d533" hidden="false">
      <profiles>
        <profile name="Staunch defenders" id="4b00-dd27-90d4-81d3" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">- Each time a model with this dogma makes a ranged attack that targets a unit within half range, the Armour Penetration characteristic of that attack is improved by 1.
- Each time an enemy unit declares a charge against a unit with this dogma, if this unit is not within Engagement Range of any enemy units, it can Hold Steady or Set to Defend.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
    </categoryEntry>
    <categoryEntry name="Forgeworld: Lucius" id="5100-5c78-f1aa-84e2" hidden="false">
      <profiles>
        <profile name="Solar blessing" id="b8b2-a485-edc8-4fc7" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">- Each time an attack with a Damage characteristic of 1 is allocated to a model with this dogma, add 1 to any armour saving throw made against that attack.
- Add 3&quot; to the Range characteristic of ranged weapons that models with this dogma are equipped with.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
    </categoryEntry>
    <categoryEntry name="Forgeworld: Mars" id="c553-868b-2fb3-2119" hidden="false">
      <profiles>
        <profile name="Masters of the forge" id="5945-b5d5-c169-7fdd" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">- SKITARII units with this dogma gain the Canticles of the Omnissiah ability.
- Each time a unit with this dogma is selected to shoot or fight, you can re-roll one hit roll when resolving that unit’s attacks.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
    </categoryEntry>
    <categoryEntry name="Forgeworld: Graia" id="0c30-fc1b-6c56-186f" hidden="false">
      <profiles>
        <profile name="Refusal to yield" id="9749-1b33-02fc-5f3b" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">- Each time a Combat Attrition test is taken for a unit with this dogma, it is automatically passed.
- Each time a model with this dogma would lose a wound as a result of a mortal wound, roll one D6: on a 5+, that wound is not lost.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
    </categoryEntry>
    <categoryEntry name="Forgeworld: Stygies VIII" id="84fd-bad1-01e5-04f0" hidden="false">
      <profiles>
        <profile name="Shroud protocols" id="6205-c571-2803-4a5d" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">- Each time a ranged attack targets a unit (excluding VEHICLE units without the CORE keyword) with this dogma, if the attacker is more than 12&quot; away, then the target is treated as having the benefits of Dense Cover against that attack.
- Each time a unit with this dogma declares a charge, none of the targets of that charge can Hold Steady or Set to Defend.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
          <modifiers>
            <modifier field="hidden" type="set" value="false">
              <conditionGroups>
                <conditionGroup type="or">
                  <conditionGroups>
                    <conditionGroup type="and">
                      <conditions>
                        <condition childId="08f1-d244-eb44-7e01" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="true" percentValue="false" scope="ancestor" shared="true" type="instanceOf" value="1"/>
                        <condition childId="c8fd-783f-3230-493e" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="true" percentValue="false" scope="ancestor" shared="true" type="instanceOf" value="1"/>
                      </conditions>
                    </conditionGroup>
                  </conditionGroups>
                  <conditions>
                    <condition childId="3d52-fccf-10c0-3fae" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="true" percentValue="false" scope="ancestor" shared="true" type="instanceOf" value="1"/>
                  </conditions>
                </conditionGroup>
              </conditionGroups>
            </modifier>
          </modifiers>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Shroud protocols" id="c17f-270d-f4ce-0262" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">- Each time a ranged attack targets a VEHICLE or MONSTER unit (excluding units with the CORE keyword) with this dogma, if the attacker is more than 18&quot; away, then the target is treated as having the benefits of Dense Cover against that attack.
- Each time a unit with this dogma declares a charge, none of the targets of that charge can Hold Steady or Set to Defend.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
          <modifiers>
            <modifier field="hidden" type="set" value="false">
              <conditionGroups>
                <conditionGroup type="and">
                  <conditions>
                    <condition childId="3b77-decb-d468-6bcc" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="true" percentValue="false" scope="ancestor" shared="true" type="instanceOf" value="1"/>
                    <condition childId="c8fd-783f-3230-493e" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="true" percentValue="false" scope="ancestor" shared="true" type="instanceOf" value="1"/>
                  </conditions>
                </conditionGroup>
              </conditionGroups>
            </modifier>
          </modifiers>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
    </categoryEntry>
    <categoryEntry name="Forgeworld: Ryza" id="eb2c-6311-d07f-dae1" hidden="false">
      <profiles>
        <profile name="Red in Cog and Claw" id="844e-bb2c-fb7a-59f2" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">- Each time a model with this dogma makes a melee attack, if it made a charge move, was charged, or performed a Heroic Intervention this turn, add 1 to that attack’s wound roll.
- Add 1 to charge rolls made for units with this dogma.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
    </categoryEntry>
    <categoryEntry name="Forgeworld: Metalica" id="6f5f-8df0-08c3-b159" hidden="false">
      <profiles>
        <profile name="Relentless march" id="2e56-8adc-338a-32b4" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">- Models with this dogma do not suffer the penalty to hit rolls incurred for firing Assault weapons in the same turn that their unit has Advanced.
- Models with this dogma do not suffer the penalty to hit rolls incurred for firing Heavy weapons in the same turn that their unit has moved.
- While an enemy unit is within Engagement Range of a unit from your army with this dogma, that enemy unit is treated as being at below Half-strength.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
    </categoryEntry>
