                            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Each time a ranged attack targets a unit with this dogma, if the attacker is more than 12&quot; away, subtract 1 from the Strength characteristic of that attack.</characteristic>
