        <profile name="Machine Focus" id="cb3c-7662-938a-9b12" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">In your Command phase, select one friendly FORGE WORLD CORE, FORGE WORLD KATAPHRON SERVITORS or FORGE WORLD SERVITORS unit within 6&quot; of this model.
Until the start of your next Command phase:
- If that unit has the KATAPHRON SERVITORS or SERVITORS keyword, can perform actions as if it had the INFANTRY keyword.
- While that unit is performing an action, it can make ranged attacks without that action failing.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
