          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Each time this unit Advances, until the end of the turn, the Type characteristic of Pistol weapons models in this unit are equipped with is changed to Assault. 
