              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">In your Command phase, select one friendly &lt;FORGE WORLD&gt; SKITARII CORE unit within 9&quot; of this WARLORD, or select one friendly &lt;FORGE WORLD&gt; CORE DATA-TETHER unit on the battlefield. 
Until the start of your next Command phase, models in that unit do not suffer the penalty to hit rolls incurred for firing:
- Heavy weapons in the same turn that their unit has moved.
- Assault weapons in the same turn that their unit has Advanced.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
