              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">In your Command phase, select one friendly &lt;FORGE WORLD&gt; SKITARII CORE unit within 9&quot; of this WARLORD, or select one friendly &lt;FORGE WORLD&gt; CORE DATA-TETHER unit on the battlefield. 
