              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Add 3&quot; to the range of the bearer’s aura abilities (to a maximum of 9&quot;). Each time the bearer uses an ability in your Command phase that specifies a range, you can add 3&quot; to the range of that ability (to a maximum of 9&quot;).</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
