              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">While a friendly FORGE WORLD CORE or FORGE WORLD KATAPHRON SERVITORS unit is within 6&quot; of this model, that unit is eligible to charge and shoot in a turn in which it Fell Back, but if it does so, each time a model in that unit makes a ranged attack, subtract 1 from that attack’s hit roll.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
