                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">While a friendly FORGE WORLD KATAPHRON SERVITORS or FORGE WORLD SERVITORS unit is within 6&quot; of this model, each time a model in that unit would lose a wound, roll one D6: on a 4+, that wound is not lost.</characteristic>
